The :678 sorry's STATEMENT is `Nonempty (X ≃ₜ S²) → kirovGenus X = 0` (bare
topological homeo). The biholo transport needs a HOLOMORPHIC degree-1 map; a bare
homeo provides none. Producing one from genus data is RR (keystone-gated, and
circular here); from nothing it is uniformization. So the transport can close the
genus-0 conclusion of the SINGLE-SIMPLE-POLE chain (the Abel-wall A3 use, the
challenge-critical path) but NOT the bare-homeo backward headline itself.
rkirov's own docstrings (GenusZeroOfSphere.lean) agree the bare-homeo statement's
only route is the de Rham wall. Gap analysis claim "(b) free by-product discharges
the 4th sorry" is overstated; its own "coordinate with rkirov (changes the
advertised route of his backward headline)" footnote flags the issue.

